(Now we need to process sca:)
(- create_candidate sca)
(- allocate vehicle to sca (we can use vuA now available))
(- attach_task_profile sca rtp)
(- assign operator resource sca op)
(- assign skill_certificate sca skill)
(- assign compliance_certificate sca cc)
(- confirm_candidate_preparedness sca rtp (now candidate_prepared))
(- load container onto leg: load_container_onto_leg sca lcA leg (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_transport_leg_linked sca leg, candidate_loading_container_linked sca lcA, loading_container_available lcA, transport_leg_assembled leg, transport_leg_loading_authorized leg, not loading_container_loaded lcA). We have all.)
(- stage schedule candidate: stage_schedule_candidate sca lcA leg rtp (requires candidate_prepared, candidate_loading_container_linked sca lcA, loading_container_loaded lcA, loading_container_leg_linked lcA leg, candidate_task_profile_linked sca rtp, not origin_leg_loaded leg, not candidate_staged_for_loading sca). We have not origin_leg_loaded (false), not candidate_staged_for_loading.)
(- verify_loading_profile_nominal sca skill op lcA leg (requires candidate_staged_for_loading sca, candidate_skill_certificate_linked sca skill, candidate_operator_linked sca op, candidate_loading_container_linked sca lcA, loading_container_leg_linked lcA leg, not destination_leg_loaded leg, not candidate_loading_verified sca). We have not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_loading_verified.)
(- establish_clearance_nominal sca cc lcA leg (requires candidate_loading_verified sca, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked sca cc, candidate_loading_container_linked sca lcA, loading_container_leg_linked lcA leg, not origin_leg_loaded leg, not destination_leg_loaded leg, not candidate_clearance_established sca). We have not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_clearance_established.)
(- finalize_candidate_direct sca (requires candidate_clearance_established sca, not route_sequence_context_set sca, not candidate_finalized sca). We have not set route_sequence_context_set (we avoided those actions). So we can finalize, giving dispatch_ready sca.)
(- allocate dispatch slot for sca: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate sca ds rtp (requires dispatch_ready sca, candidate_task_profile_linked sca rtp, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated sca). ds is available after destination dispatch.)
(- execute schedule dispatch: execute_schedule_dispatch sca vuA ds (requires dispatch_allocated sca, candidate_vehicle_linked sca vuA, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked sca ds, not dispatched sca). We have vehicle vuA allocated to sca earlier, not yet dispatched. Good.)
(After execution, sca dispatched, vuA available, ds available.)
